      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRISH LAD (4) lines up chasing three wins on end after scoring over 300m at this track in 17.39 last time, set up by a fast early sectional. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. KINGSBRAE MAGGIE (1) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (17.97) last time in a Grade 3/4 at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from four starts. Has ability and can atone. KICKER MINI (3) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.48 beating SPITFIRE GEORGE. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. LITTLE BIG GUY (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
